background:
  color: $paper
  type: solid
pageType: content
notes: 核心机制一：LLM只摘录不计算
elements:
  - bounds: [64, 38, 400, 16]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      text: PART 03 · HOW
      wrap: false
    elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 60, 832, 40]
    content:
      style: $title
      text: 机制一：LLM 只摘录、不计算
      wrap: false
    elementId: title
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 108, 832, 1]
    elementId: rule
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $line, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [64, 134, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      color: $orange
      text: 常见做法 · 让 LLM 直接算
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-bad
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 162, 396, 170]
    border: {color: $line, style: solid, width: 1}
    elementId: box-bad
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [82, 176, 360, 146]
    content:
      style: $body
      fontSize: 12
      color: $gray
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>把原文丢给模型，让它直接输出"数量 4、单价 1200、金额 4800、高于均价 12%"……</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">模型可能编造价格、擅自四舍五入、脑补原文没有的字段，而且<strong>错了没有任何痕迹</strong>。</p>
    elementId: box-bad-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 134, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      text: 本项目做法 · 分工写进架构
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-good
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 162, 396, 170]
    elementId: box-good
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $beige, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [518, 176, 360, 146]
    content:
      style: $body
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· LLM 只产出<strong>原文片段 + 置信度</strong>，原文怎么写就怎么摘录</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 数量 / 单价 / 金额的解析与核对，<strong>全部由规则代码完成</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 均价、偏离度、标色判断，只发生在比价阶段</p>
    elementId: box-good-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 360, 832, 1]
    elementId: rule2
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $line, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [64, 384, 832, 60]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 15
      color: $ink
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>LLM 输出层<span style="color:$orange"><strong>禁止出现计算值</strong></span> —— 这不是一句 prompt 叮嘱，</p>
        <p>而是流水线契约：能规则解决的，就不用 LLM。</p>
    elementId: bottom-emph
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 478, 560, 16]
    content:
      style: $small
      text: 技术分享 · 报价单提取比价工具
      wrap: false
    elementId: footer
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [860, 478, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: $mono
      fontSize: 12
      align: [right, top]
      text: '15'
      wrap: false
    elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
